%% RideShare Platform — Client-Facing Feature Map
%% Business-level feature overview, no technical endpoints or implementation detail.

mindmap
  root((RideShare<br/>Platform))
    (Rider App)
      Sign up & sign in with OTP
      Book a ride with upfront fare
      Choose vehicle category
      Live driver tracking
      Pay online or cash
      In-app wallet
      Ride history & invoices
      Rider membership plans
      Rate & review drivers
      Ride notifications
      Cancel a ride
    (Driver Experience)
      Guided step-by-step onboarding
      Document upload & verification
      Vehicle registration
      Go online / offline
      Accept or decline ride offers
      Subscription membership
      In-app wallet & earnings
      Cash collection
      Referral program
      Manage logged-in devices
    (Fare & Pricing)
      Upfront transparent estimates
      Time-based pricing
      Traffic-based pricing
      Zone & airport pricing
      Demand surge pricing
      Automatic tax handling
      Fair-fare GPS protection
      Historical rate accuracy
    (Smart Matching)
      Nearest available driver
      Rating-weighted matching
      Reliability-weighted matching
      Expanding search radius
      Block problem pairs
    (Live Tracking & Safety)
      Real-time driver location
      ETA & trip progress
      Full ride status history
      GPS data quality checks
    (Payments & Memberships)
      Online and cash ride payments
      Digital invoices
      Driver subscription plans
      Rider membership plans
      Wallet balance & adjustments
      Multiple payment providers
    (Multi-Country Ready)
      Multiple currencies
      Multiple timezones
      Per-country tax rules
      Per-country fare rates
      Multi-language content
    (Admin Portal)
      Live operations dashboard
      Rider management
      Driver approval workflow
      Ride management & cancellation
      Payment records & invoices
      Vehicle categories & pricing
      Zones & geofencing
      Country / state / city setup
      Fare rule configuration
      Subscription plan management
      Wallet administration
      Onboarding configuration
      Audit log
      Role-based access control
    (Reliability & Trust)
      Full admin audit trail
      No permanent data deletion
      Automated fare protection
      Document & legal compliance
